WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.381
- She's an American singer, songwriter,

00:00:02.381 --> 00:00:05.842
actress, reality TV star,
and fashion designer.

00:00:05.842 --> 00:00:08.837
She rose to fame with the
release of her debut single,

00:00:08.837 --> 00:00:10.533
"I want to Love You Forever."

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.981
She's the founder of the
Jessica Simpson Collection,

00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:16.313
a fashion line clothing that's
worth a billion dollars.

00:00:16.313 --> 00:00:18.937
She's Jessica Simpson and
here are her top 10 rules

00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:19.937
for success.

00:00:23.035 --> 00:00:24.361
- We always take trips.

00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:26.692
We'll go to Paris and we'll
do our inspiration shopping.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:30.342
But I love to go into vintage stores.

00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:33.500
I love to go into vintage record stores.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.750
I'm inspired by art, music.

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:42.203
I love and appreciate
every person out there,

00:00:45.872 --> 00:00:47.802
whether it be a musician or--

00:00:47.802 --> 00:00:48.811
I have all these--

00:00:48.811 --> 00:00:50.978
I collect vintage records.

00:00:52.039 --> 00:00:56.358
So, I think album art is always
a cool way to be inspired

00:00:56.358 --> 00:00:57.191
as well.

00:00:58.842 --> 00:01:02.233
I think from other people's mistakes.

00:01:02.233 --> 00:01:04.484
I mean, being in the
public eye for so long,

00:01:04.484 --> 00:01:08.651
I've made a ton of mistakes
and everybody knows about them.

00:01:10.281 --> 00:01:12.019
But I don't look at,

00:01:12.019 --> 00:01:15.549
I look at my mistakes
and any sort of failure

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:20.020
that I have gone through
as a lesson to be learned.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:23.520
And I work through it and success follows.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.947
I truly remain inspired
by each and every woman

00:01:32.476 --> 00:01:33.476
that I meet.

00:01:34.774 --> 00:01:38.223
My mother is a huge part of my business.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:41.556
She is my mentor throughout all of this.

00:01:43.878 --> 00:01:47.943
She's been styling me since
I came out of the womb.

00:01:47.943 --> 00:01:51.184
And I trust her with my business

00:01:51.184 --> 00:01:54.184
and just being a part of it with her

00:01:55.164 --> 00:01:57.774
and all of our design teams.

00:01:57.774 --> 00:02:01.223
It's not just me, it's not just my ideas.

00:02:01.223 --> 00:02:05.857
And I think that it's really
important to humble yourself

00:02:05.857 --> 00:02:08.513
and really understand
that you would never have

00:02:08.513 --> 00:02:11.975
the business that you have if
it weren't for all the people

00:02:11.975 --> 00:02:14.458
that are helping you get there.

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:17.475
I feel like the most empowering lesson

00:02:17.475 --> 00:02:22.213
that I have learned is,
failure is okay sometimes.

00:02:22.213 --> 00:02:26.055
And in that we grow and we learn from that

00:02:26.055 --> 00:02:29.944
and there's success around the corner.

00:02:29.944 --> 00:02:32.417
And we have done so many different things

00:02:32.417 --> 00:02:36.841
in growing this brand
and it just continues.

00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:39.488
It continues to keep on keepin' on.

00:02:39.488 --> 00:02:41.856
And we're just very, very blessed.

00:02:41.856 --> 00:02:46.582
And when I say "we're," it's
not just me that is my brand.

00:02:46.582 --> 00:02:49.496
There are so many people
that deserve the credit

00:02:49.496 --> 00:02:51.899
for the Jessica Simpson Collection.

00:02:51.899 --> 00:02:54.325
I've had flight attendants
come up to me and say,

00:02:54.325 --> 00:02:57.272
"I have to wear Jessica
Simpson shoes because they're

00:02:57.272 --> 00:03:00.768
the only ones that are
comfortable for me to stand

00:03:00.768 --> 00:03:02.815
on the whole flight."

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:04.192
And I listened.

00:03:04.192 --> 00:03:05.922
I think that that's important too.

00:03:05.922 --> 00:03:09.414
Really just listening to your customer

00:03:09.414 --> 00:03:12.197
and to the people that are
giving you the feedback.

00:03:12.197 --> 00:03:16.364
Whether it's criticism or
honoring and being people like,

00:03:19.571 --> 00:03:20.721
"Thank you so much!

00:03:20.721 --> 00:03:22.416
I met the cutest guy last night because of

00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:23.726
that dress that I wore."

00:03:23.726 --> 00:03:25.653
(laughing)

00:03:25.653 --> 00:03:27.301
You know, I listen to all of it.

00:03:27.301 --> 00:03:30.968
It's okay to cry and
it's okay to feel upset

00:03:32.213 --> 00:03:34.210
because there's always perseverance

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.453
and there's always success

00:03:35.453 --> 00:03:38.216
and there's always a way to get back up

00:03:38.216 --> 00:03:39.368
and make it happen again.

00:03:39.368 --> 00:03:41.632
So, I think that within any moment,

00:03:41.632 --> 00:03:45.049
if you see somebody locked in their fear,

00:03:46.389 --> 00:03:49.040
I encourage you to go and speak to them

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.981
and help them through it.

00:03:50.981 --> 00:03:54.372
I feel like I was always
taught to just believe

00:03:54.372 --> 00:03:57.705
that success is right around the corner.

00:03:59.323 --> 00:04:01.573
And I truly feel successful

00:04:03.038 --> 00:04:05.638
but there's still so much left to do.

00:04:05.638 --> 00:04:09.805
And I think that in not
stopping or thinking that,

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:14.705
"Okay, well, well, that
was great now I'm done."

00:04:14.705 --> 00:04:18.167
Just always looking forward
and looking for a new adventure

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:23.090
and staying authentic to who
I am and to what my brand is.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:27.942
Well, I think that I can relate
to every woman out there.

00:04:27.942 --> 00:04:30.741
I have been every size there is.

00:04:30.741 --> 00:04:33.945
So, I know how to dress every body type.

00:04:33.945 --> 00:04:38.635
I truly believe that it's
not just about high fashion.

00:04:38.635 --> 00:04:41.119
We all need pieces in our
wardrobe that are fashionable

00:04:41.119 --> 00:04:44.536
but accessible, wearable, and affordable.

00:04:45.532 --> 00:04:48.141
I think that that's really
what has made the brand

00:04:48.141 --> 00:04:49.204
such a success.

00:04:49.204 --> 00:04:51.751
- What were your expectations of yourself?

00:04:51.751 --> 00:04:54.718
Did you ever think it could
turn into something like this?

00:04:54.718 --> 00:04:55.745
- I had no idea.

00:04:55.745 --> 00:04:57.962
I mean, we really just
started out with shoes

00:04:57.962 --> 00:05:02.281
and accessories and now
we're going into active wear

00:05:02.281 --> 00:05:05.499
and we have maternity and
we're going into home and--

00:05:05.499 --> 00:05:06.775
- [Interviewer] Fragrance.

00:05:06.775 --> 00:05:09.184
- Hopefully opening stores soon.

00:05:09.184 --> 00:05:13.351
So, it's just continuing to
expand and grow everyday.

00:05:14.465 --> 00:05:18.632
The team around me, respects
that I give them the credit

00:05:20.469 --> 00:05:21.745
and they want to work for me.

00:05:21.745 --> 00:05:25.912
They want the line to succeed
because they believe in me.

00:05:27.956 --> 00:05:30.928
And so, to surround myself with family

00:05:30.928 --> 00:05:35.305
and the people that
work on the collection,

00:05:35.305 --> 00:05:38.722
it's just, it's the heart of my business.

00:05:40.181 --> 00:05:43.498
And I appreciate each
and every one of them

00:05:43.498 --> 00:05:46.963
and I would never ever take the credit.

00:05:46.963 --> 00:05:48.178
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:05:48.178 --> 00:05:51.073
I made this video because
Robin Nicole's songwriter

00:05:51.073 --> 00:05:52.189
asked me to.

00:05:52.189 --> 00:05:53.476
So, if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:05:53.476 --> 00:05:55.764
that you want me to profile next,

00:05:55.764 --> 00:05:58.262
leave it in the comments below
and I'll see what I can do.

00:05:58.262 --> 00:06:00.144
I'd also love to know
which of Jessica Simpson's

00:06:00.144 --> 00:06:02.547
top 10 rules meant the most to you.

00:06:02.547 --> 00:06:03.835
Leave it in the comments

00:06:03.835 --> 00:06:05.589
and I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:06:05.589 --> 00:06:06.993
Thank you so much for watching.

00:06:06.993 --> 00:06:10.576
Continue to believe and I'll see you soon.

